- Hostname: ${cleanDomain}
- DNS A Rows: ${JSON.stringify(dnsA || "not found")}
- DNS AAAA Rows: ${JSON.stringify(dnsAAAA || "not found")}
- DNS MX Records: ${JSON.stringify(dnsMX || "not found")}
- DNS TXT Records: ${JSON.stringify(dnsTXT || "not found")}
